<title>DENMARK: Danish '97 state budget economic estimates - table.</title>
<headline>Danish '97 state budget economic estimates - table.</headline>
<dateline>COPENHAGEN 1996-08-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Main figures from Danish 1997 draft state budget issued on Tuesday: (percent growth)</p>
<p>							  1996	1997</p>
<p> GDP						    1.8	  3.0</p>
<p> Inflation					    2.0	  2.3</p>
<p> Private consumption				2.3	  2.9</p>
<p> Unemployment					 9.0	  8.6</p>
<p> Exports						0.8	  1.7</p>
<p> Imports						1.1	  2.4</p>
<p> C/A surplus (billion crowns)		   9.9	 11.4</p>
<p> Govt public sector deficit (bln crns)    -15.3	 -5.8</p>
<p> State budget deficit     (bln crowns)     31.0	 22.6</p>
<p>--Chris Follett, Copenhagen newsroom +45-33969652</p>
</text>
